rence letters. Are you free tomorrow at 10 a.m.?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely! Do I need to come to the restaurant?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: Yes. See you tomorrow morning.", "time": "30000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le18ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}